All rights reserved.

Each file is licensed as stated in its own header (SPDX-License-Identifier
line or license notice). The full text of every license is in the LICENSES/
directory. This file summarizes the licenses of the files built into
libUeiPal.a / UeiPalTest (see Makefile.arm) and the installed headers. If
this summary and a file header disagree, the file header applies.


